<title>USA: Tseng Labs Inc Q4 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Tseng Labs Inc Q4 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN, Pa. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.58	   loss   $0.05</p>
<p> Net loss	  11,054	 loss    983</p>
<p> Sales	     3,020		    7,255</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  19,079		   18,952</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.73	   profit $0.03</p>
<p> Net loss	  13,965	  profit 477</p>
<p> Sales	     26,231		   37,115</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  19,020		   18,983</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 1996 includes one-time charges of about $13.89 million, or $0.48 per share, related primarily to inventory and pricing adjustments and the write-down of investments and commitments relating to its 2D product line and a minority investment in a start-up multimedia entity.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
